{"asset_key":"mn3/herohub_story_10414040","episode":"mn3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10414040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041404001:1":{"text":"여기서 야영하실 건가요? 이럴 줄 알았으면 집에 연락이라도 할 걸 그랬어요...","source_cn":"准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949D299ED0E6AA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1041404001":{"text":"여기서 야영하실 건가요? 이럴 줄 알았으면 집에 연락이라도 할 걸 그랬어요...","source_cn":"准备扎营休息了吗？早知道就给家里捎个信了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949D299ED0E6AA98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041404002:1":{"text":"사냥 가면 가끔 밖에서 자는데, 미리 말씀드리지 않으면 가족들이 걱정해서요.","source_cn":"我打猎时偶尔会住在外面，但如果不提前说一声的话，家里人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5103C2D17EA2B7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041404003:1":{"text":"부모님은 일찍 돌아가셨고, 할머니, 할아버지는 연세가 많으셔서 집에 있는 동생들이 난리 치기 시작하면 많이 버거우실 거예요.","source_cn":"我父母不在了，爷爷奶奶岁数也大了，家里小孩子闹起来他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD075E6B1A90E230F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041404004:1":{"text":"메린, 너한테 남동생, 여동생이 있다고 했었지?","source_cn":"我记得梅瑞特你说过，有弟弟妹妹的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE49977F3744CFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1041404004":{"text":"메린, 너한테 남동생, 여동생이 있다고 했었지?","source_cn":"我记得梅瑞特你说过，有弟弟妹妹的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE49977F3744CFED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041404005:1":{"text":"어렸을 때는 할머니, 할아버지가 돌봐주셨는데, 이제는 몸이 안 좋아지셔서 가끔 저를 도와주시는 정도죠.","source_cn":"早年有爷爷奶奶帮忙照顾，不过他们身体也不是很好，只能说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A905186C99D6FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041404006:1":{"text":"그래도 남동생, 여동생도 많이 컸고, 요즘은 철도 들어서 예전보단 많이 좋아졌어요.","source_cn":"但弟弟妹妹岁数也大了，至少懂事了，比之前好过不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43E98E0C04E53D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1041404006":{"text":"그래도 남동생, 여동생도 많이 컸고, 요즘은 철도 들어서 예전보단 많이 좋아졌어요.","source_cn":"但弟弟妹妹岁数也大了，至少懂事了，比之前好过不少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43E98E0C04E53D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041404007:1":{"text":"음... 힘들 때가 많죠. 돌봐야 할 사람이 많으니까요.","source_cn":"嗯，有时候会有点辛苦啦。毕竟太多人要我照顾了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19CE915A27880111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041404008:1":{"text":"하지만 가족들이 행복해하는 모습을 보면 또 보람을 느껴요.","source_cn":"但当看到他们的笑脸时，又会觉得很值得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2725C3F42D3D5CB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041404009:1":{"text":"지금 같은 시기에 곁에 대가족이 있다는 게 정말 큰 행운처럼 느껴져요!","source_cn":"毕竟，在这个时候还能拥有这么多亲人在身旁，真是件很幸运...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA21DB421BA9282C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"대가족이 같이 살면 무슨 느낌이지?","source_cn":"拥有这么大的家庭是什么感觉呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB72D8199EB36FDB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"대가족이 같이 살면 무슨 느낌이지?","female":"대가족이 같이 살면 무슨 느낌이지?","variant_male_record_index":"62702","variant_female_record_index":"62703","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"많이 힘들지?","source_cn":"很辛苦吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6E9F5B9BA3D1D807","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"많이 힘들지?","female":"많이 힘들지?","variant_male_record_index":"62700","variant_female_record_index":"62701","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"집에?","source_cn":"家里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x81AFE2A3C2BD7820","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"집에?","female":"집에?","variant_male_record_index":"62